    {
      "name": "nvdCpeReference__ref",
      "description": "The page's address.",
      "comments": [
        "NVD's own pattern, with its single quote written as \\x27, which means the same. gen-python cuts a raw string at a single quote."
      ],
      "from_schema": "https://w3id.org/lmodel/nist-nvd/nvd_cpe",
